msgstr "MTU redus"

#. Feature indicator (warning) shown when the network path cannot carry
#. full-size packets; the tunnel adapts automatically.
#. Available placeholders:
#. %(mtu)s - the measured usable packet size in bytes
msgctxt "connect-view"
